          "FadeInTime": 3,
          "FadeOutTime": 0.5,
          "FontSize": 0.5,
          "HoldTime": 2,
          "InternalID": null,
          "MessageText": {
            "Text": "The machines rose from the \nashes of the nuclear fire.\nTheir war to exterminate \nmankind has raged for\ndecades, but the final\nbattle would not be fought\nin the future. \nIt would be fought here,\nin our present. \nTonight...",
            "TextColor": "0.87907,0.87907,0.87907,0.54",
            "FontName": "GorDIN",
            "FontSize": 0,
